{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "——在顺利地完成了“初夜”之后的当下。", "text_idx": 182, "plain": "——在顺利地完成了“初夜”之后的当下。", "plain_idx": 182, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在这几天里，\\n爱理已经进入了心无旁骛的集中学习状态。", "text_idx": 183, "plain": "在这几天里，爱理已经进入了心无旁骛的集中学习状态。", "plain_idx": 184, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她手边的参考书也是堆积如山，\\n在我来的这段时间里，她也醉心在刻苦的学习中。", "text_idx": 185, "plain": "她手边的参考书也是堆积如山，在我来的这段时间里，她也醉心在刻苦的学习中。", "plain_idx": 186, "len": 38, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你真的很认真呢，爱理」", "text_idx": 187, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 188, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar2994", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那当然了」", "text_idx": 190, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar2995", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "对我发自肺腑流露出来的这句台词，\\n爱理呼了一口气回答道。", "text_idx": 192, "plain": "对我发自肺腑流露出来的这句台词，爱理呼了一口气回答道。", "plain_idx": 193, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这就是我濑名爱理啊」", "text_idx": 194, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar2996", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……认真，强硬，坚强。\\n班里的任何人都要退避三舍的优等生。", "text_idx": 196, "plain": "……认真，强硬，坚强。班里的任何人都要退避三舍的优等生。", "plain_idx": 197, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但其实她不只是这样的女孩子——\\n虽说只有我知道就是了。", "text_idx": 198, "plain": "但其实她不只是这样的女孩子——虽说只有我知道就是了。", "plain_idx": 199, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，加油」", "text_idx": 200, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你能这么说，我很开心」", "text_idx": 201, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar2997", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……抱歉」", "text_idx": 203, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar2998", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「道歉什么？\\n　啊，总之先让我进被炉里吧」", "text_idx": 205, "plain": "「道歉什么？　啊，总之先让我进被炉里吧」", "plain_idx": 206, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……在那之后过了一段时间了呢」", "text_idx": 207, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar2999", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……啊，是啊」", "text_idx": 209, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不、不过，\\n　我觉得我真的很对不起新吾」", "text_idx": 210, "plain": "「不、不过，　我觉得我真的很对不起新吾」", "plain_idx": 211, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3000", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「考试结束之后，\\n　让我们把下流的事情做个够吧」", "text_idx": 213, "plain": "「考试结束之后，　让我们把下流的事情做个够吧」", "plain_idx": 214, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3001", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“初夜”以来，我们从未再性爱过。", "text_idx": 216, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "只不过，\\n我倒是还没听过爱理一副认真的表情说出这种话……", "text_idx": 217, "plain": "只不过，我倒是还没听过爱理一副认真的表情说出这种话……", "plain_idx": 218, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我还是拎得清的」", "text_idx": 219, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯……谢谢」", "text_idx": 220, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3002", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然感到有些可惜，\\n但也不能光做这事吧。", "text_idx": 222, "plain": "虽然感到有些可惜，但也不能光做这事吧。", "plain_idx": 223, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "而且我们也确实交合在了一起。\\n既然心里有了底，就能拎得清了。", "text_idx": 224, "plain": "而且我们也确实交合在了一起。既然心里有了底，就能拎得清了。", "plain_idx": 225, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "——不过，从某种意义来说，\\n能在考试前完成自己的心愿真是太好了。", "text_idx": 226, "plain": "——不过，从某种意义来说，能在考试前完成自己的心愿真是太好了。", "plain_idx": 227, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……还有，做那个还是有点痛……」", "text_idx": 228, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3003", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……等、等下！这太犯规了！」", "text_idx": 230, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「诶？！为、为什么？」", "text_idx": 231, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3004", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「抱歉我想紧紧抱着你……」", "text_idx": 233, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「额……」", "text_idx": 234, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3005", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好，好了该学习了！！\\n　要是我们再来一次下流的接吻\\n　那人家可就覆水难收了」", "text_idx": 236, "plain": "「好，好了该学习了！！　要是我们再来一次下流的接吻　那人家可就覆水难收了」", "plain_idx": 237, "len": 41, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3006", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是、是啊……毕竟爱理一做这事立马就会沉迷进去呢」", "text_idx": 239, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……新吾才是一做这事那儿马上就大起来了」", "text_idx": 240, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3007", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好了学习吧！」", "text_idx": 242, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好色，好色～……♪\\n　知道你这点的，只有我哦……」", "text_idx": 243, "plain": "「好色，好色～……♪　知道你这点的，只有我哦……」", "plain_idx": 244, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3008", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……不管怎么说，爱理这么努力，\\n我也不能输给她。", "text_idx": 246, "plain": "……不管怎么说，爱理这么努力，我也不能输给她。", "plain_idx": 247, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "作为她的男朋友，同时也是班级委员的搭档。\\n我取出了笔记和文具，开始追赶爱理的学习进度。", "text_idx": 248, "plain": "作为她的男朋友，同时也是班级委员的搭档。我取出了笔记和文具，开始追赶爱理的学习进度。", "plain_idx": 249, "len": 44, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……新吾为了我这么努力，\\n　人家也要拿出干劲来呢」", "text_idx": 250, "plain": "「……新吾为了我这么努力，　人家也要拿出干劲来呢」", "plain_idx": 251, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3009", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好……」", "text_idx": 253, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3010", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "爱理也重新鼓起了干劲，\\n她再一次集中精力于手边的笔记中。", "text_idx": 255, "plain": "爱理也重新鼓起了干劲，她再一次集中精力于手边的笔记中。", "plain_idx": 256, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「母亲，看看我的考试成绩吧……」", "text_idx": 257, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3011", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 188, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这句嘟哝，让我的心里莫名其妙地苦闷了起来。", "text_idx": 259, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……对了」", "text_idx": 260, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3012", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「饭好像煮好了呢。\\n　新吾，麻烦再等一等，\\n　等做完手头上的事我再去分成小块」", "text_idx": 262, "plain": "「饭好像煮好了呢。　新吾，麻烦再等一等，　等做完手头上的事我再去分成小块」", "plain_idx": 263, "len": 41, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3013", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "听到一段电子音，爱理从浴室里探出头来。", "text_idx": 265, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她是去打扫浴室了。", "text_idx": 266, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯……」", "text_idx": 176, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我会把饭一块儿煮然后分成小份，再冷冻起来\\n　这样做的话还挺方便的……」", "text_idx": 267, "plain": "「我会把饭一块儿煮然后分成小份，再冷冻起来　这样做的话还挺方便的……」", "plain_idx": 268, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3014", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在学习的间隙，爱理也在努力做着家务。", "text_idx": 270, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……一个人住真辛苦啊。", "text_idx": 271, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "而且平时还要努力打工。", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "即便如此，爱理的学习却能做得很好，\\n一直在维持着优秀的成绩。", "text_idx": 273, "plain": "即便如此，爱理的学习却能做得很好，一直在维持着优秀的成绩。", "plain_idx": 274, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……让我来帮你做饭吧？」", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「谢……谢谢，帮大忙了！\\n　把一碗饭的份量用保鲜膜包起来，放在那里。\\n　等凉了之后再放进冰箱……」", "text_idx": 276, "plain": "「谢……谢谢，帮大忙了！　把一碗饭的份量用保鲜膜包起来，放在那里。　等凉了之后再放进冰箱……」", "plain_idx": 277, "len": 51, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3015", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……爱理真的好努力啊。", "text_idx": 279, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "爱理一直都是这样努力过来的。\\n已经到了不帮忙不行的地步了。", "text_idx": 280, "plain": "爱理一直都是这样努力过来的。已经到了不帮忙不行的地步了。", "plain_idx": 281, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我想帮助爱理。", "text_idx": 282, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "作为男性，作为男友，都会这么想吧。", "text_idx": 283, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不过……」", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『母亲，看看我的考试成绩吧……』", "text_idx": 285, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 188, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这份努力……果然还是出于对校长的赌气吗？", "text_idx": 286, "plain": "这份努力……果然还是出于对校长的赌气吗？", "plain_idx": 286, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那，明天见，爱理」", "text_idx": 287, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊……等一等」", "text_idx": 288, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3017", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔？」", "text_idx": 290, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啾」", "text_idx": 291, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3018", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔」", "text_idx": 293, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……晚安，新吾」", "text_idx": 294, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3019", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，好，晚安」", "text_idx": 296, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嘿嘿……」", "text_idx": 297, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3020", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "新吾真是的，看他那脸通红的样子。", "text_idx": 299, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "他总是防不住出其不意的袭击呢\\n……好可爱。", "text_idx": 300, "plain": "他总是防不住出其不意的袭击呢……好可爱。", "plain_idx": 301, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「明明平时都是让我撒娇的～……\\n　真是的，好喜欢，好喜欢新吾，嘿嘿，嘿嘿嘿」", "text_idx": 302, "plain": "「明明平时都是让我撒娇的～……　真是的，好喜欢，好喜欢新吾，嘿嘿，嘿嘿嘿」", "plain_idx": 303, "len": 39, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3021", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "——我更要加油了。", "text_idx": 305, "plain": "——我更要加油了。", "plain_idx": 305, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我已经不再孤身一人。", "text_idx": 306, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "是有了最爱的人，\\n还和他全身心地交融在了一起。", "text_idx": 307, "plain": "是有了最爱的人，还和他全身心地交融在了一起。", "plain_idx": 308, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好了……」", "text_idx": 309, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3022", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我回忆着新吾柔软的嘴唇的触感，\\n同时我重新进入了学习的状态，继续着手于学习。", "text_idx": 311, "plain": "我回忆着新吾柔软的嘴唇的触感，同时我重新进入了学习的状态，继续着手于学习。", "plain_idx": 312, "len": 39, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "学习可以说是进展顺利。", "text_idx": 313, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "确实状态越来越好。\\n精神也越来越集中了。", "text_idx": 314, "plain": "确实状态越来越好。精神也越来越集中了。", "plain_idx": 315, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "按这个状态……这个状态……", "text_idx": 316, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这次也要，取得第一名……", "text_idx": 317, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……好冷」", "text_idx": 318, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3023", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "一股让人直打颤的寒意袭来。", "text_idx": 320, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "今晚好像变得更冷了。", "text_idx": 321, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
