{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我反射性地挺直了腰板。", "text_idx": 342, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……抱歉」", "text_idx": 203, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3029", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": "兰华", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『什么事？』", "text_idx": 344, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "rk0222", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那个……我有点想关心一下妈妈。\\n　今晚变冷了嘛……」", "text_idx": 346, "plain": "「那个……我有点想关心一下妈妈。　今晚变冷了嘛……」", "plain_idx": 347, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3030", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": "兰华", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『因为这种事情跟我打电话真稀奇啊。\\n　而且还是这种考试前的时间点』", "text_idx": 349, "plain": "『因为这种事情跟我打电话真稀奇啊。　而且还是这种考试前的时间点』", "plain_idx": 350, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "rk0223", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……我知道啊。\\n虽然我也不知道为什么要打电话给她。", "text_idx": 352, "plain": "……我知道啊。虽然我也不知道为什么要打电话给她。", "plain_idx": 353, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是，\\n也用不着用这种说话口气吧……", "text_idx": 354, "plain": "但是，也用不着用这种说话口气吧……", "plain_idx": 355, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 111, "speaker": "兰华", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『你那边才是，有在好好学习吗？』", "text_idx": 356, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "rk0224", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 112, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那……那是肯定的啊，我又不是妈妈你这种人！」", "text_idx": 358, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3031", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 113, "speaker": "兰华", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『是吗……』", "text_idx": 360, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "rk0225", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 114, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 188, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3032", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 115, "speaker": "兰华", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『话说完了？』", "text_idx": 363, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "rk0226", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 116, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……嗯」", "text_idx": 365, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3033", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 117, "speaker": "兰华", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『那我挂了哦』", "text_idx": 367, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "rk0227", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 118, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "电话被挂了。", "text_idx": 369, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 119, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………～～！」", "text_idx": 370, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3034", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 120, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我窝了一肚子火，把已经没有妈妈声音的手机扔向了被子。", "text_idx": 372, "plain": "我窝了一肚子火，把已经没有妈妈声音的手机扔向了被子。", "plain_idx": 372, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 121, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在一声叹息后，我重新拿起了自动铅笔。", "text_idx": 373, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 122, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……我要认真了」", "text_idx": 374, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3035", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 123, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我移动着笔。", "text_idx": 376, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 124, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "像是被人催促了一般。", "text_idx": 377, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 125, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……毕竟我们约好了」", "text_idx": 378, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3036", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 126, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "是因为我自己说出口的……", "text_idx": 380, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 127, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那我就只能认真去做了，\\n　我也没有别的长处了啊……！」", "text_idx": 381, "plain": "「那我就只能认真去做了，　我也没有别的长处了啊……！」", "plain_idx": 382, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3037", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
